synopsis: "OIDs of built-in PostgreSQL types"
description: """
postgres_oids is a tiny dependency-free library exporting the OIDs of
commonly-used built-in PostgreSQL types, as assigned in the pg_type system
catalog. Built-in type OIDs are stable across PostgreSQL versions, so these
constants can be used when speaking the PostgreSQL wire protocol, e.g. to
select per-column result formats.
"""
